            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **The menu bar no longer jumps as the thinking word changes.** While a
  session runs, Perch's label keeps the same width as its word rotates, so
  the icons beside it stay put.

### Changed
- The Settings window does less work while it's open, and stops working
  entirely once it's closed.
]]></description>
